  "name": "DDEV",
  "summary": "Open the database of a DDEV project in TablePro with ddev tablepro.",
  "description": "DDEV ships a tablepro command on macOS. Run ddev tablepro in a project folder: DDEV starts the project if it is stopped, then opens its MySQL, MariaDB or PostgreSQL database in TablePro as a connection named after the site.\n\nThe command passes DDEV's default database user and password in a connection URL and targets TablePro by bundle ID. Nothing is saved unless you save the connection in TablePro.",
